    <title>《死侍3》：漫威没死，福斯走好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66adad257349f7a5576e0430</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66adad257349f7a5576e0430</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Aug 2024 04:08:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>死侍是漫威救世主吗？至少在我们看来，他不是。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与其说《死侍与金刚狼》是来解决漫威收购福斯之后如何将福斯曾经拥有的漫威角色版权送进 MCU 的问题，不如说是死侍，或者瑞恩·雷诺兹，送给福斯漫威电影系列的一首挽歌，一个让那些因第四面墙外的现实问题而未来得及说再见的角色能够出来好好告别的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从这点上来说，就值回票价了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈🌈🌈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>阿直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：豆瓣《死侍2》影评《找到89个彩蛋》文章作者</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 死侍是漫威救世主吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 最惊喜彩蛋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 电影是现实的影射</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 突然cue到《女浩克》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 电影的缺点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 商业爆米花电影怎么不能卖情怀了？</span></p>]]></description>
