  <item>
    <title>《寂静之地：入侵日》：末日下，猫好，人也好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66836adecdd230b23b9920ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66836adecdd230b23b9920ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 02:50:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《寂静之地：入侵日》最大的笑点就是宣传海报上写着「别出声，活下去」，孰知本片讲的其实是「找死」的故事。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmnDtxf07AiZHIj3SgtvSF-k7SK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>这部电影把一个将死之人放到了所有人都在求活的环境，这个切入点非常新鲜，同时我们也认为本片主角的角色设定也很少见，整部电影的观感和《寂静之地》系列的前两部作品是相当不同的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最最重要的是，这部电影，猫好！可能那句「别出声，活下去」是对猫说的。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span><br><span>🌈🌈🌈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>阿直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：暂时是个编剧</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><span>▌时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 末日请到圣火喵喵教避难所歇息</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 赛道转变，缺点是不惊悚了，优点是大胆的创新</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 末日环境下人类与人类之间互相帮助，很不正常么？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 男女主角反刻板性别气质</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 幽你一默</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 既然打着前传的名号，就得干点前传该干的事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a> 剧情上消失的支线</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3005">50:05</a> 穿帮细节</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 系列创作初衷是想说在电影院里发出噪音的都该被怪物吃掉吧</span></p>]]></description>
