  <item>
    <title>《沙丘2》好评太多了，就让我们来吐槽一下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f2b6c567649570794ae4ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f2b6c567649570794ae4ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2024 08:35:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《沙丘2》看完了，小鸡的第一个想法是「妇女节我应该去干点别的庆祝一下，而不是惩罚自己来看这部电影」，而阿直则认为「体验犹如把手放在贝尼·杰瑟里特姐妹会的痛苦盒子里长达两个半小时」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么这部好评如潮的电影会带给我们如此痛苦的体验，且听我们细细讲来。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌题外话</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果您在 IMAX 影厅看到如图的类似提示，或许是影厅放错格式了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fij_RrV5OASVUjQcsuIIhAkwWNmo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>无</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>阿直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：小吵鸡</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 整体观感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 为什么欣赏不来它的美学设计</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> 绝美记流水账</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> 不懂就去看原著，说明改编得不好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 看的时候我只能置身事外</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 他做抉择就好像在抛硬币，正也行，反也行</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 姐妹会金手指</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> 姐妹会跟女权一点关系都没有</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 所有角色都是工具人，包括保罗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3589">59:49</a> 打戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4101">68:21</a> 重复镜头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4187">69:47</a> 请你严肃一点！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4326">72:06</a> 这个世代的《帝国反击战》？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">75:31</a> 配乐（维维诺诺上擂台）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5170">86:10</a> 维维诺诺创作力大比拼，最后赢家是赵婷</span></p>]]></description>
