  <item>
    <title>看《惊奇队长2》里这么多女的，我还要啥自行车？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6557189a51ba721857ebf567</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6557189a51ba721857ebf567</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Nov 2023 07:39:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《惊奇队长2》，是一部服务我这个女性的女性超英商业片，我被服务得很好，或者说，是一部不用担心被冒犯、被凝视且各种女性角色让女性可以轻松代入的电影，原来顺直男在电影院里舒舒服服地、毫无心理负担地，而且还会把他们捧上天地去看一部片是这么爽的一个体验，谢谢《惊奇队长2》，我现在感受到了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个漫威女粉，我光是看到这些我视如姐妹、妈咪、女儿的女性超级英雄们在大银幕上齐聚一堂、打打闹闹，看着她们的故事，我就够开心的了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈🌈🌈🌈🌈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>老直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>老直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：在线乞讨二代鹰寡的饭</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 这部电影是贝克德尔测试的超满分答卷</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> 卡玛拉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> 惊奇队长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 女武神×惊奇队长（突然不受控地开始嗑起来了）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 卡玛拉×惊奇队长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 卡玛拉×凯特·毕夏普</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a> 少年复仇者联盟与中年雷霆特工队</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2147">35:47</a> 莫妮卡×惊奇队长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 玛丽亚×惊奇队长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2537">42:17</a> 被电影之神点过才有「猫咪吃人」戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> 脆弱的顺直男第一次意识到有这种他们无法代入的电影就崩溃了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3145">52:25</a> 反转视觉语言的既定印象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3531">58:51</a> 本片缺点总的来说就是片长太短</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4300">71:40</a> 第二个彩蛋以及与《洛基》第二季的关联</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5088">84:48</a> 《洛基》第二季</span></p>]]></description>
