  <item>
    <title>让女性在电影中做回人类，而不是充气娃娃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654b3d945e08e4e313ab415e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654b3d945e08e4e313ab415e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Nov 2023 07:49:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天我们要聊的是一部没什么人看过的纪录片，叫做《洗脑影像：性、镜头和权力》，本片主要探讨的就是男性凝视的视觉语言如何在这一百多年的电影史中生根发芽，阐释什么样的镜头拍摄手法是属于男性凝视的范畴，以及讨论这样的镜头语言如何在父权制度的庇护下助长了现实世界对女性的剥削。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈🌈🌈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>老直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>老直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：女的</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 电影介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 地位——女性作为被凝视的客体存在</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 构图——女性身体部位被特写</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a> 运镜——平移或慢动作来性化女性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 布光——女性脸上不可以出现皱纹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 规训女性什么是美、什么是好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> 女性声音被消音</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4007">66:47</a> 女性要有自己的语言和工具</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5182">86:22</a> 男性凝视成为强奸文化的帮凶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5917">98:37</a> 多元化才能拯救 cinema</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌提到的影视作品</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>洗脑影像：性、镜头和权力 Brainwashed: Sex-Camera-Power</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后窗 Rear Window</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>德菲因与卡罗尔：反叛缪斯 Delphine et Carole, insoumuses</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从不，很少，有时，总是 Never Rarely Sometimes Always</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>魔力麦克 Magic Mike</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>迷失东京 Lost in Translation</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为所应为 Do the Right Thing</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>美国队长 Captain America: The First Avenger</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>复仇者联盟2：奥创纪元 Avengers: Age of Ultron</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>惊奇队长 Captain Marvel</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>神奇女侠 Wonder Woman</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>斯巴达300勇士 300</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>正义联盟 Justice League</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大侦探福尔摩斯 Sherlock Holmes</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>007之择日而亡 Die Another Day</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>自杀小队 Suicide Squad</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>猛禽小队和哈莉·奎茵 Birds of Prey: And the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley Quinn</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>X特遣队：全员集结 The Suicide Squad</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>奥本海默 Oppenheimer</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>戴洛奇小镇 第一季 Deadloch Season 1</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>芭比 Barbie</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>新女驸马</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>笑傲江湖2：东方不败 笑傲江湖II東方不敗</span><br><span></span><em><span>注：在本集中，我们提到这部片是徐克的，指的是本片是由徐克制片和编剧，本片导演为程小东。</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span>青蛇</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>愤怒的公牛 Raging Bull</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>蜘蛛侠 Spider-Man</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>奇异博士2：疯狂多元宇宙 Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>拆弹部队 The Hurt Locker</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>黑豹2 Black Panther: Wakanda Forever</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>燃烧女子的肖像 Portrait de la jeune fille en feu</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>阿黛尔的生活 La Vie d'Adèle</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>菊石 Ammonite</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>犬之力 The Power of the Dog</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>火神的眼泪 火神的眼淚</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>法兰西特派 The French Dispatch</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>银翼杀手 Blade Runner</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>性爱自修室 Sex Education</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>心跳漏一拍 Heartstopper</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>喜宴 囍宴</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
