  <item>
    <title>《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》：蜘蛛侠出柜让我很感同身受</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6486e87c53a5e5ea147c13b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6486e87c53a5e5ea147c13b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Jun 2023 09:42:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》暌违五年终于回归，作品质量不负众望地不输上一集《蜘蛛侠：平行宇宙》。除了大部分观众都会夸的动画水平，我们作为酷儿观众更是在本片里面看到了蜘蛛侠类似于出柜的身份困扰与纠结。当然，从这一点出发，我们也认为本片的剧情有一部分是相当冗长，或者说是——无病呻吟。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈🌈🌈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>老直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>老直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：带着疯狂咳嗽上班的剪辑师（又爆音了对不起</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 「欲知后事如何，且听下回分解」的观感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 绕不过的最大的优点：绘画</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 详聊朋克蜘蛛侠的拼贴画风</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> 小黑蛛画风反而平庸</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 惊鸿一瞥的乐高蜘蛛侠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 感谢 MCU 让超级英雄有归属感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 格温蛛的「出柜」剧情让本酷儿非常感同身受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> 超英电影让超英敢于现身，政治正确电影保护弱势群体</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a> 不解小黑蛛这个「直男」有什么「出柜」困扰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 格温蛛的经历告诉我们要经济独立</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 好想拥有一个超英父母</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> 酷儿彩蛋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> 意料之外的遗憾：音乐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 第三部还能怎么拍？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 奥斯卡·伊萨克和海莉·斯坦菲尔德的配音功力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2574">42:54</a> 老直最喜欢的新蜘蛛侠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a> 凡尔赛的小黑蛛</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 2099 不是反派，他只是 INTJ 而已</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 索尼和迪士尼达成统一战线</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 关于多元宇宙，我们的疑惑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a> 结尾</span></p>]]></description>
