  <item>
    <title>《银河护卫队3》是漫威的回光返照还是东山再起？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646590c46752b5f9de697dd8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646590c46752b5f9de697dd8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 May 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《银河护卫队》系列终章上映了，这一次，对自第四阶段以来的漫威电影总是不满意的观众，终于可以满意了。但是，《银河护卫队3》究竟是漫威完蛋前的回光返照，还是在这一集重振士气之后，加上近期迪士尼、漫威高层变动等原因，漫威能够再次迎来它的东山再起？今天，酷儿快乐水（AKA 漫威快乐水）来聊聊《银河护卫队3》这部电影。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌电影酷儿指数</span></strong><span>（满分五个彩虹）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>老直：影评视频UP主</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6431508420"><span>老直的电影海滩</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>手动贩卖机：沉迷《欧卡2》耽误了本集工作进度的剪辑师</span><br><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6980940103"><span>手动贩卖机</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>每次更新我们都会在微博通知，需要的话可进行关注。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>▌时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 整体评价</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> 优点一：Gamora</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a> 优点二：动作戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 小浣熊的角色塑造</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 致敬《2001太空漫游》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 为什么《银护》不「星战」？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 片中一个过时的同志笑话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 深入研究本片笑点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> 不要太爱地球了，漫威</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> 滚导：轻描淡写社会议题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> 要多积一点电子阴德</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> 优点三：自由意志</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2821">47:01</a> 亚当术士丑到我崩溃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3232">53:52</a> 亚当术士的角色塑造</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 缺点一：笑点不好笑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3522">58:42</a> 缺点二：音乐太满了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3864">64:24</a> 本片有酷儿角色！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4062">67:42</a> 复联成员为什么不能拥有银护成员的结局？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">75:31</a> 结束语</span></p>]]></description>
